# How to Add jQuery

## Using CDN

```html
<script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>
```

---

# Basic Syntax of jQuery

```javascript
$(selector).action();
```

## Explanation

| Part | Meaning |
|------|----------|
| $ | jQuery symbol |
| selector | HTML element select karta hai |
| action() | selected element par action perform karta hai |

---

# Selectors in jQuery

Selectors HTML elements ko select karne ke liye use hote hain.

---

## Element Selector

```javascript
$("p")
```

Sabhi paragraph select karega.

---

## ID Selector

```javascript
$("#demo")
```

Specific ID select karega.

---

## Class Selector

```javascript
$(".box")
```

Specific class select karega.

---

# jQuery Document Ready Function

Ye function ensure karta hai ki pura HTML page load hone ke baad hi jQuery code execute ho.

```javascript
$(document).ready(function(){

    $("button").click(function(){

        $("p").hide();

    });

});
```

### Short Form

```javascript
$(function(){

});
```

---

# Common jQuery Methods

## hide()

Element ko hide karta hai.

```javascript
$("#box").hide();
```

---

## show()

Hidden element ko visible karta hai.

```javascript
$("#box").show();
```

---

## toggle()

Hide aur show ke beech switch karta hai.

```javascript
$("#box").toggle();
```

---

## text()

Text set ya get karta hai.

```javascript
$("#demo").text("Hello");
```

---

## html()

HTML content change karta hai.

```javascript
$("#demo").html("<b>Hello</b>");
```

---

## css()

CSS apply karta hai.

```javascript
$("#demo").css("color", "red");
```

---

## addClass()

Class add karta hai.

```javascript
$("#demo").addClass("active");
```

---

## removeClass()

Class remove karta hai.

```javascript
$("#demo").removeClass("active");
```

---

# jQuery Events

## Click Event

```javascript
$("button").click(function(){

    alert("Clicked");

});
```

---

## Mouse Enter Event

```javascript
$("#box").mouseenter(function(){

    console.log("Mouse Entered");

});
```

---

## Keypress Event

```javascript
$("input").keypress(function(){

    console.log("Key Pressed");

});
```

---

# jQuery Effects

## Fade Effects

```javascript
$("#box").fadeIn();

$("#box").fadeOut();
```

---

## Slide Effects

```javascript
$("#box").slideUp();

$("#box").slideDown();
```

---

# jQuery Chaining

Multiple methods ek hi line me use ki ja sakti hain.

```javascript
$("#box")
    .css("color", "red")
    .slideUp()
    .slideDown();
```

---

# AJAX in jQuery

AJAX ka use asynchronous requests ke liye hota hai.

## Example

```javascript
$.ajax({

    url: "data.json",

    method: "GET",

    success: function(data){

        console.log(data);

    }

});
```

---

# Example Project

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>

    <title>jQuery Introduction</title>

    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>

</head>

<body>

    <h1 id="title">Welcome</h1>

    <button id="btn">Click Me</button>

    <div id="box">
        Learning jQuery
    </div>

    <script>

        $("#btn").click(function(){

            $("#title")
                .text("jQuery is Awesome")
                .css("color", "blue");

            $("#box").slideUp().slideDown();

        });

    </script>

</body>

</html>
```

